cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Citey, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: Citey
abstract: >-
  Citey is a Chrome extension for citing software: highlight text on a web page and it shows
  export-ready citations (BibTeX, plain text or Zotero HTML) for software named there. Its hub
  generates CITATION.cff and codemeta.json files and helps authors add packages to its catalog.
